          "Make education funding adequacy a signature legislative agenda: the 30.6% college attainment rate and 36.6-year median age reflect a young district where K-12 adequacy, higher education affordability, and workforce credential-to-career alignment directly determine whether residents can build stable economic lives — this is not a peripheral issue but the core economic mobility question for majority-minority urban constituencies.",
          "Demonstrate visible institutional accountability on racial equity: police accountability, hiring equity in state contracts, health disparities reduction, and discrimination enforcement are expectations embedded in a 100% Democratic result from a 69.87% majority-minority district — performance on these fronts is not optional positioning but a baseline requirement for retaining the mandate that produced this margin.",
