          "Monitor the renter majority's shifting needs as housing costs and childcare expenses evolve: in a district where the 51.5% renter rate is among the highest competitive signals available, the representative's effectiveness on these issues directly determines whether the next election produces 94% or whether a well-organized alternative can fragment the incumbent's base."
