          "Engage the Black and Latino community leadership infrastructure with ongoing specificity: churches, community organizations, small business associations, and tenant unions are the organizing institutions through which constituents experience government responsiveness; regular presence, specific constituent case resolution, and legislative partnerships with these institutions are the foundation of durable support.",
