          "Engage professional-class governance concerns: at $153,715 median income with 69.5% college education, this is a constituency of professionals and managers who vote on governance competence, tax efficiency, and whether state and local government delivers value; messaging that speaks to operational effectiveness rather than moral absolutes better matches this district's evaluative frame.",
