          "Lead with housing affordability and rental-market access: at 55.5% renter rate and $101,680 median income, a significant constituency is paying 30-50% of income on rent in an urban market, and housing policy is not an ideological issue but a material quality-of-life issue for college-educated professionals and service-sector workers alike.",
