          "Engage young professionals and families directly on student debt policy, childcare access, and wage growth; at 42.3 median age, the district includes working-age adults whose support cannot be assumed and whose concerns differ from affluent older homeowners.",
          "Identify and intentionally serve the ~4-5% Native American or mixed-race community in the district with authentic constituent engagement rather than assumption into majority demographic framing; this population's visibility and inclusion strengthen long-term coalition durability."
