          "Build active relationship with Hispanic/Latino and Black communities: the 28.6% Hispanic and 16.3% Black populations together represent 45% of the district and are essential to the 65% margin, but require specific constituent attention on economic mobility, healthcare access, and whether Democratic governance is translating to their households' material improvement — not assumption of loyalty.",
